{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/861443-monster-from-the-deep-the-touch-of-death","id":861443,"title":"Monster from the Deep+The Touch of Death","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-07T17:08:08-07:00","id":861443,"title":"Monster from the Deep+The Touch of Death","content":"The Touch of Death allows unarmed strikes to be considered weapons with a damage rating of 2, and Monster from the Deep's low satiety effect inflicts 2L damage with unarmed strikes.<br /> Do the weapon damage bonuses to unarmed attacks those two effects grant stack or not?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-07T17:30:18-07:00","id":861453,"title":"","content":"I'd allow it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-08T00:30:05-07:00","id":861659,"title":"","content":"Idem: they are a great combo, double source of effective damage; tecnique and raw nature of the &quot;weapon&quot;.<br /> Another example: a martial artist that wear a upgraded brass knuckle +1 L .<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-08T00:54:06-07:00","id":861669,"title":"","content":"Ok, I thought the same way, but worried I'd missed a rule that would forbid it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-08T21:18:29-07:00","id":862403,"title":"","content":"Would the same apply to the low-satiety effect of Limb From Limb?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-08T21:44:38-07:00","id":862420,"title":"","content":"I can see Touch Of Death and other Fighting Style Maneuvers stacking with Monster From The Deep and other offensive Atavisms, but should Atavisms stack with each other?<br /> <br /> A Beast with Touch Of Death, Cyclopean Strength, Limb From Limb, Lair 5 and Satiety Expenditure for both of these Atavisms would have a Damage Bonus of +12A.<br /> <br /> My first thought in cases like this is to turn each point of Damage Bonus above 5 into a point of Armor Piercing. So the Beast would have a Damage Bonus of +5A and Armor Piercing 7. But if I did that, the effects of Titanic Blow might seem less appealing.<br /> <br /> Or I could make it simple and say that only the highest among the Damage Bonuses applies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 04-09-2016, 12:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-08T23:00:07-07:00","id":862454,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/861443-monster-from-the-deep-the-touch-of-death?p=862420#post862420\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or I could make it simple and say that only the highest among the Damage Bonuses applies.</div> </div> </div> </div>I could say too... but.<br /> <br /> Looming Presence and Cyclopean Strength have a synergic relation.<br /> <br /> Touch of Death is a tecnique, a style of combat; Cyclopean Strenght is an Upgrading of pure might: i have no reason to not allow this stack.<br /> Limb From Limb is a weponize atavism, just as Monster from the Deep. This too is ok.<br /> I dont stack limb to limb with monster deep, under the same logic.<br /> But i have no problem with this combo. Tecnique, upgrade of strength and a weaponize atavism.<br /> In your example, the beast had low satiety too, and this is a single attack that can hit or miss and need 2 point of satiety, a condition as prerequisite and a Lair of 5.<br /> This beast is rightly EXTRA STRONG <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> (on many levels :P )<br /> <br /> Another example : Satiety 9 , Lair 1 for the matter, a Beast use Behold my true form. She use a 9 dice + Attribute + willpower? - Stamina . With reroll 8.<br /> Spent ALL 9 of Satiety? A bonus of + 18L.<br /> And this, is a single nightmare. Want make a very massacre? Add Fear is Contagious. For a single -2, you could strike direct 2 enemy.<br /> AND the other people near must check for another roll or be hitted with a Resolve + Composure - Satiety expended.<br /> This can make a very, very nasty massacre.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":340,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/","user":"Guest","date":". 04-09-2016, 02:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-08T23:26:04-07:00","id":862471,"title":"","content":"There's no limit to the amount of satiety a beast can employ in a single turn?<br /> <br /> I think they should have some.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-08T23:32:39-07:00","id":862475,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Throne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/861443-monster-from-the-deep-the-touch-of-death?p=862454#post862454\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I could say too... but.<br /> <br /> Looming Presence and Cyclopean Strength have a synergic relation.<br /> <br /> Touch of Death is a tecnique, a style of combat; Cyclopean Strenght is an Upgrading of pure might: i have no reason to not allow this stack.<br /> Limb From Limb is a weponize atavism, just as Monster from the Deep. This too is ok.<br /> I dont stack limb to limb with monster deep, under the same logic.<br /> But i have no problem with this combo. Tecnique, upgrade of strength and a weaponize atavism.<br /> In your example, the beast had low satiety too, and this is a single attack that can hit or miss and need 2 point of satiety, a condition as prerequisite and a Lair of 5.<br /> This beast is rightly EXTRA STRONG <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> (on many levels :P )</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> You're right about this combination requiring a lot of Experiences and Satiety, which other supernaturals could dodge with Celerity, Space Arcanum, Smoke Contracts or any other </span></span></span>speed/<span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">teleportation/stealth power. The Beast will hit like a freight train, but if they miss, they'll run out of Satiety in a few turns. An Elder vampire with lots of Resilience, Vigor, Celerity can take on this Beast easily, and if they have the Juggernaut's Gait Devotion and/or Epic Iron Skin, the freight train punch does nothing.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Throne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/861443-monster-from-the-deep-the-touch-of-death?p=862454#post862454\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Another example : Satiety 9 , Lair 1 for the matter, a Beast use Behold my true form. She use a 9 dice + Attribute + willpower? - Stamina . With reroll 8.<br /> Spent ALL 9 of Satiety? A bonus of + 18L.<br /> And this, is a single nightmare. Want make a very massacre? Add Fear is Contagious. For a single -2, you could strike direct 2 enemy.<br /> AND the other people near must check for another roll or be hitted with a Resolve + Composure - Satiety expended.<br /> This can make a very, very nasty massacre.</div> </div> </div> </div> I had never thought of this tactic before! That is amazingly powerful and terrifying.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-08T23:51:58-07:00","id":862482,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/861443-monster-from-the-deep-the-touch-of-death?p=862471#post862471\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's no limit to the amount of satiety a beast can employ in a single turn?<br /> <br /> I think they should have some.</div> </div> </div> </div>The limit is how much you have. Unless you've Incarnated, spending your last dot starts a death-count, and having 10 prevents you from spending any of it at all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-09T13:11:54-07:00","id":862722,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/861443-monster-from-the-deep-the-touch-of-death?p=862482#post862482\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The limit is how much you have. Unless you've Incarnated, spending your last dot starts a death-count, and having 10 prevents you from spending any of it at all.</div> </div> </div> </div>Still ludicrous.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-09T13:37:02-07:00","id":862738,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/861443-monster-from-the-deep-the-touch-of-death?p=862722#post862722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Still ludicrous.</div> </div> </div> </div> How about [Lair] Satiety per turn when you are in the physical realm, but [Lair + 2] Satiety and/or Willpower points per turn when you are inside your Lair and thus fused with your Horror? Beasts can spend Willpower points instead of Satiety but can't use Nightmares in the latter case, right? I also believe they can spend 1 Satiety or 1 Willpower to heal all bashing damage or 1 aggravated while inside the Lair, so the increased amount of those points you can spend per turn certainly helps.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}